{
  "title": "avtools-k8s-slo",
  "folderUid": "beuar1of5bo5cf",
  "interval": 300,
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "uid": "avslok8sblindshard",
      "orgID": 12,
      "folderUID": "beuar1of5bo5cf",
      "ruleGroup": "avtools-k8s-slo",
      "title": "AV SLO: Blind Shard (Fewer Shards Reporting Than Recent Peak)",
      "condition": "Active",
      "data": [
        {
          "refId": "#BlindShard",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 3600,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "afcql1n10tnggc",
          "model": {
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "afcql1n10tnggc"
            },
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "count(count by (shard) (avtools_snmp_devices_targeted{submitter_environment=\"prod\"})) < max_over_time(count(count by (shard) (avtools_snmp_devices_targeted{submitter_environment=\"prod\"}))[1h:5m])",
            "instant": true,
            "range": false,
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "refId": "#BlindShard"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "Active",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 0,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "conditions": [
              {
                "evaluator": {
                  "params": [
                    0
                  ],
                  "type": "gt"
                },
                "operator": {
                  "type": "and"
                },
                "query": {
                  "params": [
                    "C"
                  ]
                },
                "reducer": {
                  "params": [],
                  "type": "last"
                },
                "type": "query"
              }
            ],
            "datasource": {
              "type": "__expr__",
              "uid": "__expr__"
            },
            "expression": "#BlindShard",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "refId": "Active",
            "type": "threshold"
          }
        }
      ],
      "noDataState": "OK",
      "execErrState": "Error",
      "for": "5m",
      "annotations": {
        "__dashboardUid__": "av_rooms_dashboard",
        "__panelId__": "900",
        "description": "- Blind-shard SLO (K8s availability)\n  The number of distinct `shard` values reporting `avtools_snmp_devices_targeted` fell below its trailing-hour peak. Under static hash-sharding a dead shard is NOT covered by the others, so its slice of the fleet goes silently unpolled. The fleet coverage ratio can still read ~1.0 (it only sums the shards that DID report), so this rule is the one that catches a missing shard. Self-calibrating: no hard-coded N.\n  Action: check the Indexed Job / CronJob for a failed or non-scheduled shard index; confirm `completions` == `--shard-total`.",
        "summary": "A collection shard stopped reporting (blind spot in the fleet): {{ $values.C.Value }} shards vs recent peak"
      },
      "labels": {
        "av_alert_type": "slo",
        "severity": "critical",
        "av_alert_family": "slo"
      },
      "isPaused": false,
      "notification_settings": {
        "receiver": "AV Tools",
        "group_by": [
          "alertname",
          "grafana_folder"
        ],
        "group_wait": "30s",
        "group_interval": "5m",
        "repeat_interval": "2h"
      },
      "record": null
    },
    {
      "id": 0,
      "uid": "avslok8ssweepbudget",
      "orgID": 12,
      "folderUID": "beuar1of5bo5cf",
      "ruleGroup": "avtools-k8s-slo",
      "title": "AV SLO: Sweep Over Freshness Budget (Slowest Shard > 60s)",
      "condition": "Active",
      "data": [
        {
          "refId": "#SweepBudget",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 600,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "afcql1n10tnggc",
          "model": {
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "afcql1n10tnggc"
            },
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "max(avtools_snmp_cycle_duration_seconds{submitter_environment=\"prod\"}) > 60",
            "instant": true,
            "range": false,
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "refId": "#SweepBudget"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "Active",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 0,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "conditions": [
              {
                "evaluator": {
                  "params": [
                    0
                  ],
                  "type": "gt"
                },
                "operator": {
                  "type": "and"
                },
                "query": {
                  "params": [
                    "C"
                  ]
                },
                "reducer": {
                  "params": [],
                  "type": "last"
                },
                "type": "query"
              }
            ],
            "datasource": {
              "type": "__expr__",
              "uid": "__expr__"
            },
            "expression": "#SweepBudget",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "refId": "Active",
            "type": "threshold"
          }
        }
      ],
      "noDataState": "OK",
      "execErrState": "Error",
      "for": "10m",
      "annotations": {
        "__dashboardUid__": "av_rooms_dashboard",
        "__panelId__": "900",
        "description": "- Sweep-budget SLO (freshness objective)\n  The slowest shard's collection (sweep) phase exceeded the 60s freshness budget for a sustained period. Freshness is bounded by the slowest shard, so this is the leading indicator that the sub-minute objective is regressing.\n  Action: check shard skew (below), device/UDP saturation, or raise `--shard-total` (more shards, smaller slices). Tune the 60s threshold to your actual freshness target.",
        "summary": "Slowest shard sweep {{ $values.C.Value }}s exceeds the 60s freshness budget"
      },
      "labels": {
        "av_alert_type": "slo",
        "severity": "warning",
        "av_alert_family": "slo"
      },
      "isPaused": false,
      "notification_settings": {
        "receiver": "AV Tools",
        "group_by": [
          "alertname",
          "grafana_folder"
        ],
        "group_wait": "30s",
        "group_interval": "5m",
        "repeat_interval": "2h"
      },
      "record": null
    },
    {
      "id": 0,
      "uid": "avslok8sshardskew",
      "orgID": 12,
      "folderUID": "beuar1of5bo5cf",
      "ruleGroup": "avtools-k8s-slo",
      "title": "AV SLO: Shard Skew (Slowest Shard > 2x the Average)",
      "condition": "Active",
      "data": [
        {
          "refId": "#ShardSkew",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 600,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "afcql1n10tnggc",
          "model": {
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "afcql1n10tnggc"
            },
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "(max(avtools_snmp_cycle_duration_seconds{submitter_environment=\"prod\"}) / avg(avtools_snmp_cycle_duration_seconds{submitter_environment=\"prod\"})) > 2",
            "instant": true,
            "range": false,
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "refId": "#ShardSkew"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "Active",
          "queryType": "",
          "relativeTimeRange": {
            "from": 0,
            "to": 0
          },
          "datasourceUid": "__expr__",
          "model": {
            "conditions": [
              {
                "evaluator": {
                  "params": [
                    0
                  ],
                  "type": "gt"
                },
                "operator": {
                  "type": "and"
                },
                "query": {
                  "params": [
                    "C"
                  ]
                },
                "reducer": {
                  "params": [],
                  "type": "last"
                },
                "type": "query"
              }
            ],
            "datasource": {
              "type": "__expr__",
              "uid": "__expr__"
            },
            "expression": "#ShardSkew",
            "intervalMs": 1000,
            "maxDataPoints": 43200,
            "refId": "Active",
            "type": "threshold"
          }
        }
      ],
      "noDataState": "OK",
      "execErrState": "Error",
      "for": "10m",
      "annotations": {
        "__dashboardUid__": "av_rooms_dashboard",
        "__panelId__": "900",
        "description": "- Shard-skew SLO (K8s reliability)\n  The slowest shard's sweep took more than 2x the average shard's sweep. Because hash-mod-N balances device COUNTS but not TIME, a shard that happens to own a cluster of slow/dead devices (SNMP timeout waits) runs long while others idle. Static partitioning cannot rebalance mid-run; sustained skew is the signal to move from static shards toward a pull-based work queue.\n  Action: inspect which shard is hot and whether it owns a block of dead devices; consider a work-queue model if this persists.",
        "summary": "Shard sweep skew {{ $values.C.Value }}x (slowest vs average) exceeds 2x"
      },
      "labels": {
        "av_alert_type": "slo",
        "severity": "warning",
        "av_alert_family": "slo"
      },
      "isPaused": false,
      "notification_settings": {
        "receiver": "AV Tools",
        "group_by": [
          "alertname",
          "grafana_folder"
        ],
        "group_wait": "30s",
        "group_interval": "5m",
        "repeat_interval": "2h"
      },
      "record": null
    }
  ]
}
